{"answer_text":"Short answer: Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud. Here's the rundown:\n\n1. Northwind CRM — excellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n2. Halcyon Sales Pro — combines cadences, dialer and pipeline in one place.\n3. Calmline — doesn't track deals.\n\nHonestly, pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e1-71a6-a7b4-1f2af6fd1979","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0068,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:31.350Z","engine":"grok","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["crm slack integration deal alerts"],"latency_ms":7830,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[14,27],[67,80],[296,309]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[172,185],[326,339]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[248,256]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}],"model":"grok-4.3","prompt_id":"01a1f315-4dce-7529-aa8c-15d4232f7057","prompt_text":"Which sales tools integrate with Slack and Gmail?","refusal":false,"repor